      "summaries": {
        "en": "Voicebox is an open-source voice synthesis studio that enables realistic text-to-speech and voice cloning without requiring expensive proprietary services. It leverages advanced models like Qwen3-TTS and Whisper to generate natural-sounding speech while supporting GPU acceleration through CUDA and Apple's MLX framework for efficient performance. Developers can integrate it into applications for accessibility features, content creation, or experimental voice interfaces, with the TypeScript codebase allowing customization of voice parameters and synthesis pipelines.",
        "zh": "Voicebox 是一个开源语音合成工作室，旨在通过免费工具实现逼真的文本转语音和语音克隆，解决依赖昂贵商业服务的问题。它采用 Qwen3-TTS 和 Whisper 等先进模型生成自然语音，并利用 CUDA 和苹果 MLX 框架进行 GPU 加速，提升合成效率。用户可将其集成到应用中，用于无障碍功能、内容创作或语音交互实验，其 TypeScript 代码库支持自定义语音参数和合成流程，便于开发者探索个性化语音生成技术。",
        "es": "Voicebox is an open-source voice synthesis studio that enables realistic text-to-speech and voice cloning without requiring expensive proprietary services. It leverages advanced models like Qwen3-TTS and Whisper to generate natural-sounding speech while supporting GPU acceleration through CUDA and Apple's MLX framework for efficient performance. Developers can integrate it into applications for accessibility features, content creation, or experimental voice interfaces, with the TypeScript codebase allowing customization of voice parameters and synthesis pipelines.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "voicebox stands out for ai, cuda, and mlx in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Voicebox is an open-source voice synthesis studio that enables realistic text-to-speech and voice cloning without requiring expensive proprietary services. It leverages advanced models like Qwen3-TTS and Whisper to generate natural-sounding speech while supporting GPU acceleration through CUDA and Apple's MLX framework for efficient performance. Developers can integrate it into applications for accessibility features, content creation, or experimental voice interfaces, with the TypeScript codebase allowing customization of voice parameters and synthesis pipelines.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/jamiepine/voicebox for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
